(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-compiler/tests/asl1Test.asl#" :text "Gate for the stage-1 driver asl-compiler/asl1 (plan SH unit E2), run on asl-host: asl1 build compiles tests/conformance/bootstrap/fibProgram.asl to a .ll that clang links against libaslrt.a into a program exiting 42; asl1 check passes fibProgram; on a file with an unbound symbol both commands exit 1 with the checker's diagnostic on standard error and build writes no .ll; a malformed command line exits 2 with the usage line; a program whose main takes the argument list and returns a Result builds, and native it exits as asl-host run does. asl1 check agrees with asl-host check on a fixture with an exported-but-undefined name and an Any parameter (both exit 0, HL-CHECK-UNIFY). Runs asl-host, clang and the programs through processRun in a fresh temporary directory")
(:doc :symbol "asl/packages/asl-compiler/tests/checkCacheTest.asl#" :text "Gate for the asl1 check verdict cache (CHECK-SPEED), run on asl-host with asl1 started through tools/fleet/run.asl and ASL_CHECK_CACHE in a fresh temporary workspace: cold and warm diagnostics are identical; editing a dependency so the entry fails flips the warm verdict; a forged well-formed entry is replayed byte for byte; a corrupt entry is a miss that is rewritten; the warm check of asl1.asl gives the cold output in under a third of the cold time; decodeVerdict rejects wrong keys, digests, exit codes and truncation.")
